 | `worldinfo.read_activated` | `worldinfo_read_activated` | 读取本次 run 的最终激活世界书条目；模型可读文本只包含条目名、世界书名、条目内容。 |
 | `dice.roll` | `dice_roll` | 为明确的随机、跑团或 roleplay 检定投骰；支持 `d6`、`1d20`、`3d6+4` 与纯数字。默认 Profile 不启用。 |
+| `rp.state` | `rp_state` | 读取当前 run 继承的 branch-local RP runtime / Living World state。 |
+| `rp.recall` | `rp_recall` | 搜索当前 branch 已接受的 continuity facts、knowledge、commitments、threads 与 recent beats。 |
+| `rp.stage_turn` | `rp_stage_turn` | 结构化更新本 run 的隐藏 RP persistent projection；不会直接写 chat，Adult Tension RP Profile 在 `workspace.commit` 前要求成功 stage。 |
 | `skill.list` | `skill_list` | 列出当前 Profile 可见的已安装 Skill 索引摘要。 |
 | `skill.search` | `skill_search` | 搜索当前 Profile 可见的单个 Skill 内 UTF-8 文本文件，返回 snippet/ref。 |
 | `skill.read` | `skill_read` | 读取已安装 Skill 内的 UTF-8 文本文件或范围；默认 `SKILL.md`，支持 `path`、行范围、字符范围与 `max_chars`。 |
diff --git a/docs/AdultTensionRP.md b/docs/AdultTensionRP.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ecc129e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/AdultTensionRP.md
@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@
+# Adult Tension RP — Native TauriTavern Integration
+
+## Status
+
+This source tree contains the native V1 integration for the existing
+`adult-tension` + `adult-tension-continuity` Skills.
+
+It intentionally reuses TauriTavern's Agent persistent-state branch model instead
+of embedding Python or creating a second swipe/acceptance database.
+
+## Built-in Agent Profile
+
+Select:
+
+`Adult Tension RP`
+
+Profile id:
+
+`adult-tension-rp`
+
+The profile:
+
+- exposes `rp.state`, `rp.recall`, `rp.stage_turn`;
+- allows ordinary chat/world-info/Skill reads;
+- allows output/scratch/plan/summaries workspace roots;
+- hides and denies direct model writes to `persist/`;
+- requires `rp.stage_turn` before `workspace.commit`;
+- permits up to three `rp.stage_turn` attempts so a model can correct recoverable validation errors, but allows only one successful stage per run.
+
+## Why swipe/regenerate works without another transaction layer
+
+TauriTavern already resolves `persistBaseStateId` from visible chat history before
+a run. For `swipe` and `regenerate`, the current assistant response is excluded
+from run input, so the new run begins from the earlier selected base.
+
+At `workspace.finish`, the run's persistent projection is committed to a new
+persistent state and that `persistStateId` is written into the concrete assistant
+message/swipe metadata.
+
+This gives the desired property:
+
+> each generated assistant variant owns its own RP state; the next user turn
+> naturally continues from the state attached to the selected variant.
+
+
+## Current authority parity
+
+The native branch state persists current safety/boundary/grant authority separately from historical continuity:
+
+- `safetyState`
+- `activeBoundaries`
+- current-scene `activeGrants`
+- `sceneId`, location and participants
+
+`rp.stage_turn.authority` is the only mutation path. Continuity facts cannot create or infer these values. Any scene/location/participant change conservatively withdraws the previous scene's current grants. A paused state blocks story advancement until an explicit current user turn resumes it.
+
+This V1 intentionally uses a more conservative scene-grant rule than the vendor Python runtime: it does not auto-inherit grants across adjacent private locations. Users can explicitly re-grant in the new scene.
+
+## Install/use
+
+1. Build this TauriTavern fork normally for the target platform.
+2. Import the original `adult-tension` Skill.
+3. Import the final `adult-tension-continuity` Skill.
+4. Import `extras/adult-tension-tauritavern-adapter` as a Skill ZIP.
+5. Enable Agent System.
+6. Choose `Adult Tension RP` as the active Agent Profile.
+7. Use the character/world/scenario you authored. Fixed Canon mode is the default.
+
+## Personal cloud build without signing
+
+For users without a Mac, this fork also includes a manual GitHub Actions workflow:
+
+`Personal iOS Unsigned Build`
+
+It runs on a GitHub-hosted macOS runner, can run the repository quality gate, builds the full iOS app with Apple code signing disabled, and uploads:
+
+- `TauriTavern-unsigned.ipa`
+- `TauriTavern.app.zip`
+- `build-info.json`
+- `SHA256SUMS.txt`
+
+This step deliberately does not configure certificates, provisioning profiles, App Store Connect or TestFlight. Signing/installation can be decided later without changing the RP runtime. See `docs/CurrentState/PersonalUnsignedIOSBuild.md`.
+
+## No Python runtime requirement
+
+The native profile does not execute Skill Python scripts on iOS.
+The original Python implementation remains a semantic/reference oracle only.
+
+## Data location
+
+RP state lives inside TauriTavern's existing per-chat Agent persistent-state
+snapshots under the Agent workspace storage. The run-visible logical path is:
+
+`persist/rp/state.json`
+
+Do not manually edit this file while a run is active.
+
+## Export/backup
+
+Because state is part of Agent persistent snapshots linked to chat messages, chat
+and Agent workspace backup/retention policies matter. Do not prune all persistent
+states if you need historical branch continuation.
+
+## V1 limitations
+
+- Explicit multi-branch UI and manual branch merge are not added. Existing swipe
+  selection is the branch selector.
+- Rewriting old accepted chat history can intentionally change which persistent
+  state is visible. The integration never invents state that is no longer linked.
+- The native V1 uses bounded structured continuity state, not the frozen Python
+  SQLite/JSONL implementation byte-for-byte.
+- The semantic invariants retained are authority isolation, player sovereignty,
+  knowledge separation, stable threads/commitments and fail-closed state writes.
diff --git a/docs/Agent/ToolSystem.md b/docs/Agent/ToolSystem.md
index f74cf1e..eb48922 100644
--- a/docs/Agent/ToolSystem.md
